      BooleanSignal, BooleanInput, BooleanOutput</td>
   <td valign=\"top\"><img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/UsersGuide/Signals.png\"></tr>

<tr><td valign=\"top\"><b>complex<br>blocks</b></td>
