<tr><td colspan=\"2\"><b>Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Semiconductors</b></td></tr>
<tr><td valign=\"top\"> SimpleTriac </td>
    <td valign=\"top\"> Simple triac based on semiconductor thyristor model. </td> </tr>

