        J. Wiley &amp; Sons, New York, 1966.</td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
      <td valign=\"top\">[Burton1994]</td>
      <td valign=\"top\">T. Burton
        <i>Introduction to Dynamic Systems Analysis</i>,
        McGraw Hill, New York, 1994.</td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
